{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00808","headline":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 文明舞 · 崔居俭、卢文纪","name":"郊庙歌辞 後唐宗庙乐舞辞 文明舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝业光扬，皇图翕赫。\n圣德孔彰，神功不测。\n信及豚鱼，恩沾动植。\n懿范鸿名，传之万亿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔居俭、卢文纪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00808.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00808","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}